{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_06",
  "title": "骷髏之舞",
  "storyCode": "LE-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "906bdb3fcdc3b9cab1632c88e568991998d8c29c6ec5ca49a1cce01eb97b2107",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g3_slumstreets_night"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，我來了，別再拉琴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底想做什麼，自殺嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實在考慮這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用琴聲將源石蟲吸引過來，然後......將我自己和它們一起燒成飛灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，既然你來了......我大概不會再有這樣的機會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從很小的時候開始，我就知道，自己的體質有些不尋常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的感染者和我相處時間長了，病情就會變糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為這個，我和爺爺一起被趕出了當時的住所，開始在村莊之間流浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我一直以為，不是所有的感染者都會被我影響，而且，只要相處的時間不長就不礙事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但爺爺的病終於越來越重，我的第一個幻想破滅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，芙蓉告訴我們，這種叫做“假癒”的現象，在我來到夕照區短短幾周之後，就造成了嚴重的後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然活著就會造成災難，那我還是死了的好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不怪你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼可能不怪我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你知道塵世之音嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽你說完，我......終於想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塵世之音，死於實驗的人，巫王殘黨......還有你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我全都想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這根本就不是你的錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錯在巫王，錯在那些殘黨，錯在格特魯德——但你是無辜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧了你讓我想起了那些事情，我才知道，這不是什麼與生俱來的體質，而是一場實驗的惡果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是在聽了你的大提琴之後才想起來的，我才應該向你道謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有什麼但是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情已經超出了我們的掌控，我已經連減輕自己的危害都做不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，如果那位伯爵小姐說得沒錯，我本來也時日無多，不如在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為什麼會上格特魯德的當？就是因為塵世之音是可以轉移的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我的塵世之音已經是壞的了，就算轉移給你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不試一試怎麼知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你已經決定赴死了，還有什麼好怕的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想害你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我真的受害了，你再去替我操心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這裡，我們來賭一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你平時能感受到塵世之音的旋律嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管是演奏還是施術，我都能模糊地感受到塵世之音的存在......一段已經瞭若指掌，但又和我完全沒有關係的，刺耳的旋律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我感受到的旋律並不刺耳，反而很溫柔——不對，應該說是，和諧的過了頭，到了空洞的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們倆努力去貼合各自感受到的旋律，試著合奏一場吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "合奏......可是沒有聽眾啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我們有這麼多聽眾呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石蟲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把那個老傢伙留在塵世的旋律演奏給源石蟲聽，我覺得挺好，很人道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊......你還、好嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，醒著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉重的呼吸聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......醒著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，你還能聽見塵世之音的旋律嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說實話，甚至更清晰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，是我太魯莽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往好處想，我們剛剛那段合奏把源石蟲趕走了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你給我買的新衣服——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，沒有髒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "氣味呢，不好聞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......確實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，我現在才是真的臭不可聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，我以前也曾經把自己搞得一身味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那次，烏提卡高塔不遠處的建築發生了火災，高塔里的侍從不去救火，反而都衝著我來，把我盯得死死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕你跑掉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕我跑掉，怕我藏起來，怕我葬身火海......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還怕你死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高塔上幾乎所有的窗戶都有法術加強過的柵欄和鎖，就是怕我一時想不開跳下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是重要的吉祥物，要是隨隨便便死了，他們吃不了兜著走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正，最後火沒有燒到高塔來，只是熏了我一身的煙味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就穿著那件煙燻過的外套過了半個月，直到天氣轉暖才脫掉那件衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也想起一些舊事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和爺爺被趕出一開始住的地方之後，我們就開始在一些比較富裕的村莊之間流浪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要隱藏好自己感染者的身份，大多數村莊都還算友好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在小說裡讀到過，農忙時節，友好的村民會在晚上給短工準備香腸和啤酒，讓他們吃飽喝足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "友好的村民給我們準備的是幾個小錢，在天黑之前打發我們出村，怕我們偷東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒那麼友好的村民給我們準備的，是硬邦邦的黑麵包，還有逼迫我們就範的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一次，我正幫一個村子幹農活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天氣很熱，我渾身都是汗，就想趁周圍沒人，把衣服鬆一鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在我打定主意脫衣服之前，不遠處突然亂了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爺爺跑過來告訴我趕快跑，說是一個短工以為沒人注意，把袖子捲了起來，露出了手臂上的源石結晶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "村民們當即把他扔進廢棄的地窖鎖了起來，還要挨個排查其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是爺爺，我可能也已經死在那個地窖裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死——他們會殺死感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用殺，他們也不敢殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們只需要等人餓死、結晶化、爆炸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是早就有善待感染者的法令了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是在第一次踏入移動城市之後，才知道有這麼一道法令的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......很......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒必要道歉的，你也是被那位伯爵小姐欺騙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是說，如果當年，我再勇敢一點——我能，我能在當時站出來，也許你就不用——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你真的沒必要說對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像你剛才說的，錯在製造塵世之音的人，錯在想利用塵世之音的人，但你沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我按照自己的想法保護了你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就像你現在想按照自己的想法保護我一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，白堊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我們去找芙蓉，去找車爾尼先生......會有辦法的，一定會有辦法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，等到你身上的塵世之音去除了，到那個時候，再來謝我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g4_embassy"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊的情況基本穩定，昏厥的原因基本可以確定是中毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經救助了不少中毒的患者，他們的體徵和關鍵指標都和現在的白堊類似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但關於白堊的未來......那位伯爵可能沒有撒謊。他的整體狀況確實來到了危險的邊緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你會幫我們的，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......非常想相信你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我需要證據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕是狀況證據也好，我需要客觀的事實，來證明塵世之音不是臆測，而是迫近的陰謀的一部分——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您去哪裡了，我們找了您好長時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謊言、臆測？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己說的話就能百分之百確定是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對白堊說的那些話......你知道嗎，他差一點因為你的那些話，和源石蟲同歸於盡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑鍵，白堊真的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（緩緩點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果黑鍵沒找到他，他已經那麼做了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告訴你，塵世之音是真實存在的，我可以用自己的腦袋擔保！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在沒有時間跟你們解釋，我還有事要辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我必須......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......像你這麼固執的人，我這輩子都沒見過幾個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去音樂廳的休息室，你們就什麼都明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，音樂廳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格特魯德說過，為了配合合奏時的法術，她在夕照廳裡做了一些手腳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我們現在就過去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有車爾尼，你們把他也叫上，免得你們兩個誰也說服不了誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_495_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生，您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑鍵與芙蓉對視了一眼。\n他們很想懷疑些什麼，但他們已經沒時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
